    "answer": {
      "short": "Base $15\\text{ cm}$; height $5\\text{ cm}$.",
      "worked": "Let $x$ be the height in centimetres and $b$ the base in centimetres.\n$$\\begin{align*}b&=3x\\\\A&=bx\\\\75&=3x\\times x\\\\75&=3x^2\\\\x^2&=25\\\\x&=5\\text{ cm}\\\\b&=15\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
